EventTier: "{0}, tier {1}"
WaveMedals: wave {0}: {1}
VictoryMedals: the win: {0}
BeforeAnyMechanicalBoss: before any mechanical boss
DefenderMedalsBody: The {0} gives every player medals as waves are cleared and when the event is won ({1}), {2} for a whole run. The event always comes at the highest tier the world has opened
WhenItDies: on its death, besides its loot
BossPotionBody: Besides its loot, every boss leaves 5 to 15 of one item when it dies, mostly healing potions; which one depends on the boss. The Bestiary does not list them
InAGreedPot: through the {0}
GreedPotBody: Used on a placed {0} (the {1} sells it), the ore flies in and comes out as the next ore 1 time in 3, else as {2}
AtNight: "{0} at night"
FallenStarAtNight: At night half of this chance goes to the {0} instead
SummonedWith: Summoned with {0} in hand
CrimsonShrine: Crimson shrine
CrimsonShrineBody: In the chest of Calamity's underground Crimson shrine, only in a world made with the “get fixed boi” seed
DecraftBody: Thrown into shimmer, each of these turns back into the materials of its recipe:
DecraftOne: "{0}: ×{1}"
DecraftPer: "{0}: ×{1} per {2}"
AndMore: and {0} more
DecraftAlchemy: A potion brewed at a placed bottle loses each material 1 time in 3
AnyOfItems: "{0} {^0:item;items}"
ShimmerIt: undo its recipe
ShimmerAny: undo any of their recipes
OpensWithUsedUp: Opens with {0} · used up
OpensWithKept: Opens with {0} · kept
KeyUsedUpBody: Right-click the {1} with a {0} in the inventory: opening it uses the key up
KeyKeptBody: Right-click the {1} with a {0} in the inventory or an open Void Bag: the key stays
